, make lint exit 0. PUSHED to Gerrit as change 2610 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2610). Verified may be -1 due to 8 pre-existing shared-main interface-test failures (git-128 bare-repo, another session fixing) -> will recheck once main greens. Next: 1cef review-plan (plan remediated v2), then claim+held-out-TDD+implement stacked on 5169.","timestamp":1788500631607477001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef review-plan round 1: BLOCK (1 blocker + 5 advisories). B1 [+A1,A5]: quarantine trigger #2 mislabeled container criteria (G3/G4/decomp-shape) as 'not inline-runnable', but codebase reserves that class for ISF only (INLINE_UNADMISSIBLE_CRITERIA=frozenset({'ISF'})); containers carry a DISTINCT admission-runner skip-drift reason 'container-material-unrecoverable' vs ISF's 'not-inline-admissible'. FIX: trigger #2 now CONSUMES the admission runner's own skip-drift verdict (observed=skipped, reason in {not-inline-admissible, container-material-unrecoverable}) instead of re-deriving inline-runnability or inventing a class; AC5 + Scope aligned. A2: dropped unbacked RETRYABLE claim, tied BudgetExceeded-FATAL to the ledger finalize()/reserve() path AC7 exercises. A3: named the two failure signals' sub-step sources (runner reproduction result vs emitter FixtureEmitReport.skipped_unbalanced). A4: idempotent-create not atomic -> map builder dedupes by criterion id (lowest ticket id wins), rare double-create self-healing. Desc 7986 chars, 9 ACs. Re-running review-plan.","timestamp":1788501540608008001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef review-plan round 2 = PASS (2 non-blocking advisories, folding into implementer brief: A1 - trigger#1 'reproduction-failure result' names no literal runner field; actual signal is AdmissionSummary.withheld entries + DriftEntry.reason (withheld also carries non-repro reasons, so filter by reason); A2 - two-reason framing (not-inline-admissible/container-material-unrecoverable) is correct vs the actual runner even though it rewords the parent's single-reason phrasing). CLAIMED 1cef (open->in_progress). Separately: addressed 5169 Gerrit LLM-Review -1 (1 blocking error-handling + 6 advisories): added --require-live (CI job fails visibly instead of silent exit 0 when live backend missing), null/zero-SHA before-ref selects nothing+note (no git crash), live calibration reports routed to STDERR keeping stdout a pure id list, + coverage tests (mutual-excl exit2, bad-ref exit1, .rebar/prompts rubric-shape branch) + strengthened fail-open oracle. 13/13 tests GREEN, mutation teeth confirmed (2 mutants -> RED, sandboxed). Running make lint+typecheck before amending 2610.","timestamp":1788502028320127001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"5169 gate-fix AMENDED (3def1ea9, Change-Id I7347e9f6 preserved) and PUSHED as patchset 2 on Gerrit 2610; stale LLM-Review-1 auto-removed, bot re-reviewing. Pre-flight before push: make lint exit 0 (complexity/mechanism/zizmor/actionlint all green), make typecheck exit 0 (756 files), 13/13 test_changed_criteria GREEN, mutation teeth confirmed. Now building 1cef stacked on 5169 (HEAD 3def1ea9).","timestamp":1788502182484244001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef: oracle 10/10 GREEN (held-out validated + mutation teeth proven); lint+typecheck green; committed 24c501b1 (rebar-ticket trailer+DCO+Change-Id), rebased stack onto origin/main 6b034b9, pushed to Gerrit. 5169=change 2610 (new PS), 1cef=change 2615 [NEW]. Polling both for LLM-Review+1 AND Verified+1.","timestamp":1788504957076621001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef change 2615: LLM-Review PASS (9 advisories). Triage: FIXED IN SCOPE (amended PS2) — (a) stale STUB docstring in heal_fixtures removed; (b) REAL BUG: packaged help snapshot criteria.txt stale so 'rebar criteria --help' hid heal — regenerated via gen_cli_help.py; (c) docs/cli-reference.md + docs/config-reference.md regenerated. DEFER to one follow-up ticket (Phase-5): CLI live-run cwd fallback (l123), untested LLMError path (l135), counter-reset test gap (l181), _ledger_cap==25.0 magic branch + its test gap (l258, unreachable via CLI which hardcodes cap=25), _unreliable_map tie-break test gap (l272). Amended, re-pushed PS2, lint+typecheck+oracle 10/10 green. Awaiting fresh LLM-Review + Verified on 2615; 2610 awaiting Verified (PS4).","timestamp":1788506022380952001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"CI BLOCKER (environmental, not code): 2610 Verified-1 root cause = concurrency cancellation ('Canceling since a higher priority waiting request for gerrit-verify-rebar~2610 exists') on superseded PS3, NOT a test failure. gh run list shows a large backlog of QUEUED Gerrit Verified Gate runs (06:36-07:22 all still queued/pending) = saturated runner capacity, shared-CI domain of the main-greening session. NOT rechecking (would worsen backlog). Local lint+typecheck+oracle all green. Waiting for queue to drain so 2610 PS4 + 2615 PS2 get fresh Verified runs.","timestamp":1788506595712792001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef 2615 PS2 LLM-Review-1 BLOCK (3 correctness findings) → FIXED IN SCOPE with RED-first held-out tests (PS3): (255) dropped _ledger_cap magic branch; outer ledger.reserve now uses cap_usd + reserve_usd=0.0 so ANY cap nets to the whole cap (old code trapped every non-25 cap at negative remaining). (327) _ProductionAttempter.run now maps summary.incomplete → new AttemptOutcome.INCOMPLETE (transient outage; counter unchanged, no admit/quarantine) instead of misclassifying as FAILED_REPRODUCE. (444) _drift_reason now prefers an UNMINABLE_DRIFT_REASONS entry over first-match so un-minable outranks non-reproducing. 3 new held-out tests proven RED against stashed old heal.py ('failed-reproduce' vs 'unminable' etc.), GREEN after fix. Full oracle 13/13, lint+typecheck green. Amended, pushed PS3. DEFER (Phase-5 follow-up): advisories l123 cwd fallback, l135 CLI LLMError path untested, l167 counter-drop test gap.","timestamp":1788507769576457001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2615 PS4 (1cef): resolved PS3 BLOCK. Finding 423 (cap fails open): live solver reports no priceable usage rows (bedrock-region pricing gap, out of scope for R-4). Fixed by charging the deterministic pre-flight ESTIMATE per attempt via new ledger.charge_estimate() when no priceable usage is recorded, so ledger.reserve accumulates spend and the cap fails CLOSED. RED proof: stashed old heal.py -> empty-usage run admits all 3 criteria, stopped_for_budget=False. Fixed: stops after c1,c2. Finding 292: added loop-level held-out contract test (4 INCOMPLETE sweeps never quarantine/skip). Full oracle 15/15 GREEN, ledger suite 58 pass, lint+typecheck clean. Amended (Change-Id I74ff preserved), pushed PS4. Deferred: real per-case usage pricing needs bedrock-region model normalization -> Phase-5 follow-up.","timestamp":1788509850088393001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"BLOCKER (external, not my code): Verified pending on BOTH 2610(5169) and 2615(1cef). Both are LLM-Review +1 and ALL CI jobs green EXCEPT scanner-integration, which fails repo-wide with 'could not execute .tools/review-scanners/bin/semgrep: No such file or directory' (Makefile:500 install_review_scanners.py check). Fails identically on both unrelated changes => broken main scanner lane, NOT my diff. Parallel session owns the fix: Gerrit 2616 (Revert scanner-integration Verified gate) + 2617 (De-gate scanner-integration in Verified aggregate), both currently LLM-Review -1 (mid-iteration). Per mandate: NOT fixing shared infra, NOT rechecking, NOT forcing. HOLDING: cannot close 5169/1cef without Verified +1. When 2616/2617 land on main, rebase stack onto new origin/main + re-push to get Verified, then close 5169 -> 1cef -> a5bf -> epic. My impl work is complete: 15/15 oracle GREEN, lint+typecheck clean, both LLM-Review +1.","timestamp":1788511886607970001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"REAL CI FINDING on 2615 PS4 (NOT scanner-integration, NOT flake): pytest ubuntu py3.11 FAILED deterministically (reproduced locally on py3.12). Root cause: 1cef added FixtureHealConfig to the typed Config (_config_schema _SECTION_CLASSES) + reader fixture_heal_interval_days(), but NEVER registered the 'fixture_heal' section in _config_sections._SECTIONS (the coercion+provenance single-source). Consequence: config 'values' had fixture_heal but 'sources'/provenance did not => 3 invariant oracles RED: test_operation_snapshot::test_compose_returns_snapshot_with_values_sources_root_and_version (set(sources)==set(values)), test_mechanism_delta::test_the_committed_baseline_matches_the_live_tree (config_key detector enumerates _SECTIONS, so fixture_heal.interval_days marker-admitted but undetected), and 4x test_config_surface_golden (new live key/env var). FIX (single-source): registered 'fixture_heal':{'interval_days': _as_int minimum=1} in _SECTIONS (mirrors reclaim.horizon_days) + regenerated tests/golden/config_surface.json (adds fixture_heal.interval_days + REBAR_FIXTURE_HEAL_INTERVAL_DAYS). Completes the half-wired section (now first-class: coerced, validated, provenance-tracked, env-overridable). Existing invariants ARE the RED oracle (no new test needed). All 101 config tests GREEN; make lint + typecheck exit 0. Amending -> PS5.","timestamp":1788513687626742001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pushed 2615 PS5 (Change-Id I74ff preserved; new sha 040b11d). Old LLM-Review+1 and Verified-1 outdated/removed (real code change) => fresh review+CI. Fix scope: _config_sections.py + tests/golden/config_surface.json only. 2610(5169) does NOT carry this bug (no FixtureHealConfig in its tree); its sole red remains scanner-integration (shared infra). Remaining blocker for BOTH changes' Verified+1: scanner-integration lane (other session's de-gate 2616/2617). Next: confirm PS5 clears py3.11 config-parity + regains LLM-Review+1; then hold on Verified pending de-gate landing.","timestamp":1788513758908630001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef PS6 pushed to Gerrit change 2615 (Change-Id I74ff preserved). Contains: (a) PS5 config-parity fix (fixture_heal registered in _SECTIONS + golden regen), (b) NEW per-sweep ledger reset in heal.py (Path.unlink(missing_ok=True)) fixing the PS5 BLOCK finding (cross-sweep budget accumulation -> permanent fail-closed), RED-first proven, (c) 2 advisory-clearing coverage tests. Local gates all green: oracle 18/18, ledger+config+snapshot+mechanism suites 63/63, make lint exit 0 (all ratchets), make typecheck exit 0 (758 files). Stale LLM-Review -1 removed on push. Polling PS6 for fresh review.","timestamp":1788515009855895001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef PS7 pushed (change 2615, Change-Id I74ff). Resolves PS6 BLOCK (error-handling): live 'criteria heal' CLI discarded HealReport -> now emits _write_heal_summary (ran/skipped-not-due/attempted/admitted/quarantined/skipped-unreliable/budget-stop), RED-first (3 CLI tests proven RED then GREEN). Also folded 2 test-coverage advisories: production attempter SKIPPED_UNBALANCED + FAILED_REPRODUCE branches now driven. Deferred advisories: #1 ledger double-count (fail-closed, immaterial at cap25/est0.5, ties to per-case-pricing followup) + #2 empty-gap-list ran=True (low value) -> Phase-5 sweep. Oracle 23/23, lint 0 (ratchets: complexity new=0, mechanism new=2 are other-session aa9e ci_gate admitted markers in base), typecheck 0 (758). Polling PS7 review.","timestamp":1788516246116187001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"1cef PS7 -> LLM-Review +1 (PASS). BLOCK resolved. 5 advisories all non-blocking, dispositioned: #1/#4 ledger double-count -> FILE (per-case-pricing followup); #2 broaden CLI except -> ACCEPT (narrow LLMError catch intentional, fail-loud on unexpected); #3 test LLMError arm -> FILE (cheap oracle gap, avoid churning billable review on passing change); #5 empty-gap ran=True -> ACCEPT (benign). Locking in +1. Remaining blocker: Verified gated on other-session scanner-integration de-gate (2616/2617).","timestamp":1788517165471994001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Scanner-integration de-gate landed on main (2616 revert -> origin/main cad66dd, gerrit-verify.yaml no longer references scanner). Rebased stack (5169+1cef) onto de-gated main (trivial, both Change-Ids preserved). Re-validated: oracle 23/23, lint 0 (mechanism new=0 now - reverted scanner ci_gate markers gone from baseline), typecheck 0. Pushed both: 2610 (5169) + 2615 (1cef PS8). No outdated-votes message -> trivial-rebase preserved LLM-Review +1. Awaiting fresh Verified (now unblocked).","timestamp":1788517342816797001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Both changes rebased onto de-gated main, LLM-Review +1 preserved on both (2610 PS6, 2615 PS8). Fresh Verified runs dispatched 10:22 (runs 33862887906, 33862885537) but QUEUED ~25min on CI runner backlog (shared capacity, not my